# UNDERDELVE: the hungry pick, by buttons alone. Shove the crates in the
# block room and the hole under them drops Mo down a shaft onto spikes. That
# death costs a lantern, and he comes back in the sealed chamber beside the
# shaft, where only the dead can go; a hop over a gap in its floor, and the
# chest there holds the hungry pick.
game underdelve
wait 15
cheat no_gloom
cheat room 2 3 60 130
cheat clear_enemies
hold RIGHT 150
expect room_x == 2
expect room_y == 4
wait 120
expect deaths == 1
expect lanterns == 5
expect state == 1
expect px > 200
expect py < 40
hold RIGHT 8
hold RIGHT+A 3
hold RIGHT 20
expect py < 40
press B
wait 20
expect weapon == 2
expect items & 128
expect deaths == 1
